    tuy\u1EBFn an to\xE0n."
  questInProgressLine: "Ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EE7 ba t\xEAn. \u0110\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EE9ng
    y\xEAn khi ch\xFAng nh\u1EA5c tay."
  questCompletedLine: "Van \u0111\xE3 y\xEAn. Tuy\u1EBFn n\xE0y ta v\u1EBD xong r\u1ED3i."
